DELETE /2.0/device_pinners/{device_pinner_id}
Deletes an individual device pin.
Required: device_pinner_id (path) — The ID of the device pin.

GET /2.0/device_pinners/{device_pinner_id}
Retrieves information about an individual device pin.
Required: device_pinner_id (path) — The ID of the device pin.

GET /2.0/file_version_legal_holds/{file_version_legal_hold_id}
Retrieves information about the legal hold policies assigned to a file version.
Required: file_version_legal_hold_id (path) — The ID of the file version legal hold.

GET /2.0/file_version_retentions/{file_version_retention_id}
Returns information about a file version retention. **Note**: File retention API is now **deprecated**. To get information about files and file versions under retention, see [files under retention](https://developer.box.com/reference/get-retention-policy-assignments-id-files-under-retention) or [file versions under retention](https://developer.box.com/reference/get-retention-policy-assignments-id-file-versions-under-retention) endpoints.
Required: file_version_retention_id (path) — The ID of the file version retention.

GET /2.0/sign_templates/{template_id}
Fetches details of a specific Box Sign template.
Required: template_id (path) — The ID of a Box Sign template.

GET /2.0/storage_policies/{storage_policy_id}
Fetches a specific storage policy.
Required: storage_policy_id (path) — The ID of the storage policy.
